<https://edint.es/kos/IncidentType> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme> ;
                                    rdfs:label "tipo de incidencia"@es ,
                                               "type of incident"@en .


###  https://edint.es/kos/TrafficEquipmentType
<https://edint.es/kos/TrafficEquipmentType> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
